{
  "_comment": [
    "The single declaration of what PSBD-ViT measures. Three consumers read this file and",
    "nothing else: scripts/coverage_ledger.py diffs it against results/, ",
    "pbs/generate_basis_jobs.py submits the diff, and scripts/vit_detection_tables.py",
    "reports it. Adding a config is a one-line edit here.",
    "",
    "Every panel cell carries every basis placement. That is the point: a placement ranking",
    "computed over whichever cells happened to have a placement cached ranks the cells, not",
    "the placements. The audit that motivated this file found 0 placements present in all",
    "108 cells and a bimodal split where the dense cells were the easy attacks.",
    "",
    "'id' is the results/<cell>/psbd/<id> directory name, built by",
    "psbd_dropout_sweep.cache_config_name(position_config, block_range, perturbation).",
    "Note the order: block range comes BEFORE the operator suffix, and the 'dropout'",
    "operator contributes no suffix at all."
  ],
  "asr_bar": 0.85,
  "clean_accuracy_drop_bar": -0.05,
  "panel": {
    "architecture": "vit",
    "label_modes": [
      "all_to_one",
      "clean_label"
    ],
    "poison_rates": [
      0.01,
      0.05,
      0.1
    ],
    "exclude_folder_tokens": [
      "sam_rho",
      "evade",
      "_ep",
      "a2m",
      "a2a",
      "benign",
      "seed_",
      "_trig",
      "_pilot",
      "_v2",
      "_drop0_1"
    ],
    "_canonical_variants_comment": "An attack existing in two variants keeps only the canonical one as a panel cell. Label-Consistent's patch-only runs predate the adversarial bases Turner's method requires; both variants clear the ASR bar on CIFAR-10, so the faithful one is named here and the older runs stay on disk without competing for the slot.",
    "canonical_variants": {
      "lc": "_adv"
    },
    "_canonical_targets_comment": "Clean-label GTSRB cells target class 1 because class 0 holds 0.56% of the train set and caps every rate at that share. A folder whose target_label disagrees with this map for its dataset and label mode is not a panel cell, which retires the class 0 clean-label runs by their metadata rather than by a name pattern.",
    "canonical_targets": {
      "gtsrb": {
        "clean_label": 1
      }
    },
    "forward_passes": 3,
    "mask_seed": 0
  },
  "benign_reference": {
    "_comment": "Same architecture, optimizer and 15 epochs as every panel cell, so dCA is like-for-like.",
